<title>SWITZERLAND: Valora boosts H1 net profit.</title>
<headline>Valora boosts H1 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit		     26.1		vs 20.2</p>
<p> Group cash flow		81.0		vs 75.5</p>
<p> Investment		     47.1		vs 44.7</p>
<p> Net profit per share (Sfr) 6.40		vs 4.95</p>
<p> Sales			    1,417.4	   vs 1,421.2</p>
<p>Sales by division:</p>
<p> Retail			   694.6	     vs 690.4</p>
<p> Wholesale			110.8	     vs 96.5</p>
<p> Selecta			  311.6	     vs 314.0</p>
<p> Bedding			  300.4	     vs 320.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Valora Holding AG, formerly named Merkur Holding AG, is active in retail kiosk operations, confectionary and foods, catering machines and bedding supplies.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-258 7340</p>
</text>
